            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I can reproduce. This is probably a side effect of https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/commit/5833f01484ad81da31d175e53468f761994daeaa , which should not happen.\n\nIt also looks like the behavior comes from Neovim: neovim/neovim#32203 . I'll try to find a workaround.",
