        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`; by a hacky workaround of temporarily changing picker window's local directory to be the same as the global directory. This works for a majorly common case of having only global current directory, but hopefully should work for some more convoluted setups with window- and tab-local current directories. If doesn't work for those setups, probably worthwhile to wait for Neovim fix and suggest using latest version.\n\nThanks again @shubham-cpp for spotting this!",
